[gd_scene load_steps=13 format=3]

; zone_vale_approach — the first field map (WLD-05), band 3–7.
;
; A corridor rather than a clearing: the road runs west to east between cliffs, from the gate
; back to Ember Hollow at one end to the descent into the Vale Floor at the other. The shape
; is the point — a field map the player crosses has somewhere to be going, and the camps sit
; on the way rather than scattered in an open plane.
;
; No safe ground here. This is the first map where standing still is not an option, which is
; what the village is for.

